The pinned Lean installation has a specific packaging defect: its `lean` executable is missing the CLI application entry point (`_lean_main`), while the libraries and `lake` binary are present at the pinned commit. I’m preserving that evidence and probing Lake’s exact compiler invocation so I can use a local, non-mutating launcher shim against the same pinned Lean libraries—without changing any mounted input.
